WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.291 --> 00:00:34.000
In the previous few verses,
 there was mention of such people

2
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:35.541
who don't completely surrender

3
00:00:35.541 --> 00:00:38.125
at Lord Krishna's feet.

4
00:00:38.125 --> 00:00:39.625
They also cannot understand

5
00:00:39.625 --> 00:00:43.500
Lord Krishna's infinite, indestructible form.

6
00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:46.625
Now in the remaining verses of this chapter,

7
00:00:46.625 --> 00:00:48.291
is the answer to this very thing –

8
00:00:48.291 --> 00:00:52.000
why some people cannot 
understand Lord Krishna.

9
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:54.500
Those people who are afflicted
 with material desires

10
00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:56.458
or are māyāvādīs,

11
00:00:56.458 --> 00:00:59.416
even after leaning toward spirituality,

12
00:00:59.416 --> 00:01:02.875
cannot see Lord Krishna's divine
 form, His qualities,

13
00:01:02.875 --> 00:01:05.791
and His nature.

14
00:01:05.791 --> 00:01:08.500
This twenty-fifth verse of the seventh chapter

15
00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:10.416
is focused on this thing –

16
00:01:10.416 --> 00:01:14.541
how Lord Krishna, according
 to a particular person's

17
00:01:14.541 --> 00:01:15.958
nature and desires,

18
00:01:15.958 --> 00:01:19.750
keeps Himself manifest or unmanifest.

19
00:01:24.583 --> 00:01:27.000
Lord Krishna begins this verse

20
00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:31.166
with the words 'nāhaṁ prakāśaḥ sarvasya,'

21
00:01:31.166 --> 00:01:32.541
whose meaning is

22
00:01:32.541 --> 00:01:36.625
'I am not manifest to all.'

23
00:01:36.625 --> 00:01:39.750
Yoga-māyā samāvṛtaḥ: My divine form

24
00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:44.166
remains hidden by the veil of yogamāyā.

25
00:01:44.166 --> 00:01:47.625
Mūdho 'yaṁ, nābhijānāti lokah:

26
00:01:47.625 --> 00:01:48.625
These foolish

27
00:01:48.625 --> 00:01:52.708
and ignorant people don't know Me.

28
00:01:52.708 --> 00:01:54.750
Mām ajam avyayam:

29
00:01:54.750 --> 00:01:57.958
I am unborn and indestructible.

30
00:01:57.958 --> 00:02:00.166
Lord Krishna's real form

31
00:02:00.166 --> 00:02:02.166
isn't visible to those people

32
00:02:02.166 --> 00:02:05.083
who are mūḍha, meaning foolish,

33
00:02:05.083 --> 00:02:07.875
in whom there's absence of wisdom.

34
00:02:07.875 --> 00:02:10.708
And this happens for this very reason –

35
00:02:10.708 --> 00:02:15.166
because Lord Krishna hides His
 divine form with yogamāyā.

36
00:02:15.166 --> 00:02:16.708
Yogamāyā means

37
00:02:16.708 --> 00:02:19.000
Lord Krishna's that internal power

38
00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:20.750
which hides or manifests His divine form

39
00:02:20.750 --> 00:02:24.875
according to His will.

40
00:02:24.875 --> 00:02:28.041
And because of this very yogamāyā, His unborn

41
00:02:28.041 --> 00:02:31.375
and indestructible form isn't
 visible to those people

42
00:02:31.375 --> 00:02:36.500
who are foolish and surrounded
 by material desires.

43
00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:39.500
Lord Krishna is explaining in clear words that if

44
00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:41.291
someone considers His this present

45
00:02:41.291 --> 00:02:43.333
form as only a person,

46
00:02:43.333 --> 00:02:46.166
or a perishable human body,

47
00:02:46.166 --> 00:02:48.625
then this is their very big mistake.

48
00:02:48.625 --> 00:02:50.750
Here, nirvikaravāda meaning, 

49
00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:54.041
formlessness is also refuted.

50
00:02:54.041 --> 00:02:56.375
Followers of nirvikaravāda believe

51
00:02:56.375 --> 00:02:59.333
that the Supreme Soul simply
 cannot have a form.

52
00:02:59.333 --> 00:03:02.125
Some people consider even
 Lord Krishna's this form

53
00:03:02.125 --> 00:03:04.375
as perishable human form,

54
00:03:04.375 --> 00:03:06.625
and this is their very big mistake.

55
00:03:06.625 --> 00:03:07.458
Lord Krishna,

56
00:03:07.458 --> 00:03:10.375
who is currently teaching the Gita to Arjuna,

57
00:03:10.375 --> 00:03:12.625
His this form too is eternal,

58
00:03:12.625 --> 00:03:14.833
infinite, and indestructible.

59
00:03:14.833 --> 00:03:17.375
And this is Lord Krishna's līlā,

60
00:03:17.375 --> 00:03:18.583
His glory –

61
00:03:18.583 --> 00:03:22.958
that He nourishes people holding
 every type of belief.

62
00:03:22.958 --> 00:03:24.333
But His divine form

63
00:03:24.333 --> 00:03:27.166
will manifest only for those extraordinary people

64
00:03:27.166 --> 00:03:28.791
who come to Lord Krishna with complete

65
00:03:28.791 --> 00:03:31.791
devotion and humility.

66
00:03:31.791 --> 00:03:33.625
Think in this way –

67
00:03:33.625 --> 00:03:38.166
if the sun is before you but you close your eyes,

68
00:03:38.166 --> 00:03:39.833
then darkness will remain.

69
00:03:39.833 --> 00:03:40.750
Similarly,

70
00:03:40.750 --> 00:03:43.500
if someone keeps the eyes of faith closed,

71
00:03:43.500 --> 00:03:46.625
if one remains continuously
 trapped in the fog of materiality,

72
00:03:46.625 --> 00:03:49.625
then how will one see clearly?

73
00:03:49.625 --> 00:03:51.750
Lord Krishna's form is presented,

74
00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:52.500
but it will be visible

75
00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:56.166
only to that one who will
 open their eyes with devotion

76
00:03:56.166 --> 00:03:57.458
and completely remove the fog

77
00:03:57.458 --> 00:03:59.750
of materiality.

78
00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:02.208
Here it also becomes clear that Lord Krishna

79
00:04:02.208 --> 00:04:06.750
keeping His divine form unmanifest
 is neither discrimination

80
00:04:06.750 --> 00:04:08.750
nor favoritism, rather

81
00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:11.458
this form is available to all.

82
00:04:11.458 --> 00:04:13.166
What's necessary for humans is

83
00:04:13.166 --> 00:04:17.125
only to change their mind's sentiment
 and complete surrender

84
00:04:17.125 --> 00:04:18.333
and faith

85
00:04:18.333 --> 00:04:22.041
and try to know Lord Krishna with.

86
00:04:26.666 --> 00:04:28.708
I

87
00:04:28.708 --> 00:04:32.416
manifest only before those

88
00:04:32.416 --> 00:04:37.291
whose heart is completely free

89
00:04:37.291 --> 00:04:42.666
from ego, desire, and delusion.

90
00:04:42.666 --> 00:04:44.458
But

91
00:04:44.458 --> 00:04:46.208
those who think

92
00:04:46.208 --> 00:04:50.333
that not with faith and humility, but

93
00:04:50.333 --> 00:04:53.708
with their intellect's strength they'll know Me,

94
00:04:53.708 --> 00:04:56.291
or those people who try to understand Me

95
00:04:56.291 --> 00:05:01.291
on their own terms –

96
00:05:01.291 --> 00:05:03.500
for those people,

97
00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:05.875
My true form

98
00:05:05.875 --> 00:05:09.416
will always remain invisible.

99
00:05:09.416 --> 00:05:14.458
This is a very important lesson of life,

100
00:05:14.458 --> 00:05:17.375
because all deep

101
00:05:17.375 --> 00:05:21.666
truths of life also remain hidden for those people

102
00:05:21.666 --> 00:05:24.208
who keep only logic and argument

103
00:05:24.208 --> 00:05:28.250
or the feeling of proving their superiority

104
00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:31.583
in the mind.

105
00:05:31.583 --> 00:05:32.750
If in your heart

106
00:05:32.750 --> 00:05:36.625
there's only the craving to maintain control,

107
00:05:36.625 --> 00:05:40.041
then truth and spiritual experience

108
00:05:40.041 --> 00:05:43.416
will always remain far from you.

109
00:05:43.416 --> 00:05:46.416
Because of My yogamāyā,

110
00:05:46.416 --> 00:05:48.750
My divine form

111
00:05:48.750 --> 00:05:52.750
manifests only to those

112
00:05:52.750 --> 00:05:54.916
who come with complete humility

113
00:05:54.916 --> 00:05:57.541
and surrender.

114
00:05:57.541 --> 00:06:00.416
And life is also like this.

115
00:06:00.416 --> 00:06:03.750
Life's joy manifests only

116
00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:07.875
when you remain humble.

117
00:06:07.875 --> 00:06:11.041
In mutual relationships too, true sweetness

118
00:06:11.041 --> 00:06:15.791
is understood only when
 there's love in the mind,

119
00:06:15.791 --> 00:06:18.625
not the craving to show

120
00:06:18.625 --> 00:06:23.083
one's superiority before each other.

121
00:06:23.083 --> 00:06:24.208
If seen,

122
00:06:24.208 --> 00:06:28.250
obtaining true knowledge
 and making spiritual progress

123
00:06:28.250 --> 00:06:30.750
isn't at all difficult,

124
00:06:30.750 --> 00:06:33.375
and life is also quite simple.

125
00:06:33.375 --> 00:06:33.958
But

126
00:06:33.958 --> 00:06:37.041
for the human surrounded by craving and ego,

127
00:06:37.041 --> 00:06:39.833
all these simple things

128
00:06:39.833 --> 00:06:43.041
seem extremely difficult.

129
00:06:43.041 --> 00:06:44.958
Life's true secret

130
00:06:44.958 --> 00:06:47.958
will be known, will be understood

131
00:06:47.958 --> 00:06:52.375
only by one who abandons
 the craving to control it.

132
00:06:52.375 --> 00:06:55.375
When you make your heart pure,

133
00:06:55.375 --> 00:06:59.000
abandon cravings and ego,

134
00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:01.875
then life's truths themselves

135
00:07:01.875 --> 00:07:05.166
manifest before you.

136
00:07:05.166 --> 00:07:07.333
Understanding Me,

137
00:07:07.333 --> 00:07:12.583
or being able to experience life's sweet essence,

138
00:07:12.583 --> 00:07:16.000
this won't happen on your terms,

139
00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:18.500
because then this is ego –

140
00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:22.500
that you're so great that everything

141
00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:26.041
comes to you of your own will.

142
00:07:26.041 --> 00:07:29.666
Think about it – humans make the mistake

143
00:07:29.666 --> 00:07:30.750
of adopting this perspective

144
00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:35.125
in many situations of life.

145
00:07:35.125 --> 00:07:36.875
They want something,

146
00:07:36.875 --> 00:07:41.125
but aren't willing to change for it.

147
00:07:41.125 --> 00:07:42.833
There, if you're

148
00:07:42.833 --> 00:07:47.125
humbly ready to learn,

149
00:07:47.125 --> 00:07:48.833
then I

150
00:07:48.833 --> 00:07:52.791
Myself am ready

151
00:07:52.791 --> 00:07:57.375
to show you My form and make you

152
00:07:57.375 --> 00:07:59.666
experience life's sweetness.

153
00:07:59.666 --> 00:08:01.000
Ultimately,

154
00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:04.708
you must make this choice.

155
00:08:04.708 --> 00:08:08.416
I will definitely keep inspiring you,

156
00:08:08.416 --> 00:08:13.000
just as I'm doing through this Gita teaching.

157
00:08:17.458 --> 00:08:22.208
My real form isn't visible to all

158
00:08:22.208 --> 00:08:23.833
because

159
00:08:23.833 --> 00:08:26.291
when on a human's mind

160
00:08:26.291 --> 00:08:29.541
material desires overshadow,

161
00:08:29.541 --> 00:08:34.125
then truth becomes hazy.

162
00:08:34.125 --> 00:08:35.833
In family life,

163
00:08:35.833 --> 00:08:39.708
this is often seen that truth is present

164
00:08:39.708 --> 00:08:41.791
but doesn't appear.

165
00:08:41.791 --> 00:08:45.541
Like some person who only in position,

166
00:08:45.541 --> 00:08:48.541
wealth, property, and fame's goals

167
00:08:48.541 --> 00:08:51.750
is completely enchanted

168
00:08:51.750 --> 00:08:54.958
but still is sad

169
00:08:54.958 --> 00:08:59.875
that why is there absence of love in their life.

170
00:08:59.875 --> 00:09:01.833
Now you tell me –

171
00:09:01.833 --> 00:09:04.708
if someone in material goals

172
00:09:04.708 --> 00:09:05.875
and desires only

173
00:09:05.875 --> 00:09:08.791
has become completely enchanted,

174
00:09:08.791 --> 00:09:11.750
keeps looking only toward them,

175
00:09:11.750 --> 00:09:14.333
then will ignore

176
00:09:14.333 --> 00:09:19.250
how many priceless moments of love.

177
00:09:19.250 --> 00:09:21.416
Love is around,

178
00:09:21.416 --> 00:09:24.041
but isn't visible.

179
00:09:24.041 --> 00:09:26.291
In parents' blessings,

180
00:09:26.291 --> 00:09:29.625
in children's innocent laughter,

181
00:09:29.625 --> 00:09:34.458
in life partner's love, care, and attention.

182
00:09:34.458 --> 00:09:35.916
But for one who on eyes

183
00:09:35.916 --> 00:09:39.083
has tied the blindfold of material attachment,

184
00:09:39.083 --> 00:09:42.208
where will all this be visible?

185
00:09:42.208 --> 00:09:46.833
In such times, a question
 should arise in the mind.

186
00:09:46.833 --> 00:09:47.958
Am I

187
00:09:47.958 --> 00:09:50.333
truly able to understand

188
00:09:50.333 --> 00:09:53.583
my family relationships,

189
00:09:53.583 --> 00:09:56.875
or has my ambitions' curtain

190
00:09:56.875 --> 00:10:00.000
covered my vision?

191
00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:01.708
Making effort for success

192
00:10:01.708 --> 00:10:03.833
is certainly not bad,

193
00:10:03.833 --> 00:10:06.875
but if absence of love starts being felt in life,

194
00:10:06.875 --> 00:10:11.041
loneliness is being experienced,

195
00:10:11.041 --> 00:10:14.541
if family members have started seeming

196
00:10:14.541 --> 00:10:19.083
like obstacles in your progress's path,

197
00:10:19.083 --> 00:10:21.708
then become alert.

198
00:10:21.708 --> 00:10:24.625
Remove the curtain of ambitions

199
00:10:24.625 --> 00:10:30.500
a little from the eyes and see, everything
 will start appearing clear to you.

200
00:10:30.500 --> 00:10:31.750
Then again,

201
00:10:31.750 --> 00:10:34.458
now with open eyes,

202
00:10:34.458 --> 00:10:37.208
accepting family's love, giving them

203
00:10:37.208 --> 00:10:42.083
love, also move forward toward your success.

204
00:10:42.083 --> 00:10:44.166
Just as I

205
00:10:44.166 --> 00:10:47.541
manifest only before those,

206
00:10:47.541 --> 00:10:51.416
who come with surrendered sentiment, similarly

207
00:10:51.416 --> 00:10:55.500
the truth of relationships also manifests only

208
00:10:55.500 --> 00:11:01.458
when you see them with love and sensitivity.

209
00:11:01.458 --> 00:11:05.625
Success and sensitivity – the right answer

210
00:11:05.625 --> 00:11:08.625
is in the balance of both.

211
00:11:13.166 --> 00:11:17.375
Those people who are filled with ego

212
00:11:17.375 --> 00:11:19.375
and think

213
00:11:19.375 --> 00:11:21.166
that they know everything,

214
00:11:21.166 --> 00:11:25.625
they know everything, those very people

215
00:11:25.625 --> 00:11:30.083
remain deprived of true guidance.

216
00:11:30.083 --> 00:11:32.333
This is the reason

217
00:11:32.333 --> 00:11:34.083
that My form

218
00:11:34.083 --> 00:11:37.416
manifests only before those,

219
00:11:37.416 --> 00:11:38.750
who with faith

220
00:11:38.750 --> 00:11:42.833
and humility come to Me.

221
00:11:42.833 --> 00:11:44.708
To them this spiritual

222
00:11:44.708 --> 00:11:48.708
path's truth is visible, because

223
00:11:48.708 --> 00:11:55.166
their eyes aren't covered by ego.

224
00:11:55.166 --> 00:12:00.000
In the business world too,
 this is completely true.

225
00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:02.291
If someone thinks

226
00:12:02.291 --> 00:12:05.833
they know everything,

227
00:12:05.833 --> 00:12:07.916
then they themselves are

228
00:12:07.916 --> 00:12:11.666
indirectly saying

229
00:12:11.666 --> 00:12:15.500
that their progress is now not possible.

230
00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:17.416
Think about it,

231
00:12:17.416 --> 00:12:22.250
because one who knows everything,

232
00:12:22.250 --> 00:12:26.291
has stopped, right?

233
00:12:26.291 --> 00:12:27.750
There,

234
00:12:27.750 --> 00:12:30.208
if someone remains humble,

235
00:12:30.208 --> 00:12:34.041
then they'll learn something
 new in every situation,

236
00:12:34.041 --> 00:12:36.500
and one who learns more,

237
00:12:36.500 --> 00:12:39.000
will progress more.

238
00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:41.750
You too in your organization

239
00:12:41.750 --> 00:12:44.333
will find many such people

240
00:12:44.333 --> 00:12:47.500
who only in showing themselves superior

241
00:12:47.500 --> 00:12:52.041
to others become so busy in their effort

242
00:12:52.041 --> 00:12:56.166
that they ignore even a well-wisher's advice.

243
00:12:56.166 --> 00:13:00.500
Those people also lose the
 opportunity to receive guidance.

244
00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:04.000
And because of their this ego,

245
00:13:04.000 --> 00:13:10.583
colleagues also slowly stop giving them advice.

246
00:13:10.583 --> 00:13:12.583
There, you'll also see

247
00:13:12.583 --> 00:13:14.583
many such people

248
00:13:14.583 --> 00:13:17.208
who are very high in position,

249
00:13:17.208 --> 00:13:20.500
but are still humble.

250
00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:22.708
Meet everyone with affection.

251
00:13:22.708 --> 00:13:26.000
Don't reject anyone's given suggestion, rather

252
00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:31.083
show gratitude for that suggestion.

253
00:13:31.083 --> 00:13:33.250
Suggestion –

254
00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:36.541
is a form of love only,

255
00:13:36.541 --> 00:13:37.500
because suggestion

256
00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:41.250
will only be given by one who wants your good.

257
00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:43.833
Remember this thing.

258
00:13:43.833 --> 00:13:47.750
Yes, whether that suggestion
 is appropriate or not,

259
00:13:47.750 --> 00:13:51.500
for some reason you'll be able to act on that suggestion

260
00:13:51.500 --> 00:13:55.875
or not, you can decide that thoughtfully.

261
00:13:55.875 --> 00:13:59.333
This is in your hands, but any suggestion

262
00:13:59.333 --> 00:14:03.166
rejecting straight away

263
00:14:03.166 --> 00:14:09.125
is a big sign of ego.

264
00:14:09.125 --> 00:14:11.416
If you think

265
00:14:11.416 --> 00:14:14.000
that you know everything,

266
00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:19.291
then people will naturally
 create distance from you

267
00:14:19.291 --> 00:14:22.333
There, if you have eagerness to learn

268
00:14:22.333 --> 00:14:26.250
and affection and respect toward others,

269
00:14:26.250 --> 00:14:29.541
then experienced people too with you

270
00:14:29.541 --> 00:14:31.041
their secrets

271
00:14:31.041 --> 00:14:33.875
will be inspired to share.

272
00:14:33.875 --> 00:14:38.250
Those people too will
 be desirous of your progress.

273
00:14:38.250 --> 00:14:42.083
Never forget humility.

274
00:14:42.083 --> 00:14:43.125
This not only

275
00:14:43.125 --> 00:14:46.166
will be helpful in spiritual progress,

276
00:14:46.166 --> 00:14:49.583
but in professional success too

277
00:14:49.583 --> 00:14:52.583
will prove important.

278
00:14:52.583 --> 00:14:57.208
Just as I only by being attracted through faith

279
00:14:57.208 --> 00:14:59.875
manifest before you,

280
00:14:59.875 --> 00:15:04.416
similarly in professional life success too

